# Who owns each published docs page, in CODEOWNERS format.
#
# `manni meta derive` reads this file for the stewardship `owner` field, through
# `meta.derive.codeowners` in manni.config.yaml. It lives here rather than at a
# path GitHub searches (`.github/`, the repository root or `docs/`), so it
# stamps an owner without turning on GitHub's automatic review requests.
# Last matching line wins, as in CODEOWNERS. It names the published pages
# only: this file is read by every manni run under the repository, the test
# suite included, so a catch-all would give every fixture an owner.

/docs/src/content/docs/ @hawkeyexl
